id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAD","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"依本段明示主體及晉惠公、重耳即位或襄公領兵的敘事判讀，晉君隨主體切換，不按同字跨段套用。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0146","start":146,"end":149,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"7du_pfa_2s5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p037","text":"三十六年，繆公復益厚孟明等，使將兵伐晉，渡河焚船，大敗晉人，取王官及鄗，以報殽之役。晉人皆城守不敢出。於是繆公乃自茅津渡河，封殽中尸，為發喪，哭之三日。乃誓於軍曰：「嗟士卒！聽無譁，余誓告汝。古之人謀黃髪番番，則無所過。」以申思不用蹇叔、百里傒之謀，故作此誓，令後世以記余過。君子聞之，皆為垂涕，曰：「嗟乎！秦繆公之與人周也，卒得孟明之慶。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"孟明","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"7du_pfa_2s5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"孟明","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p079","text":"晉先軫曰：「秦伯不用蹇叔，反其衆心，此可撃。」欒枝曰：「未報先君施於秦，撃之，不可。」先軫曰：「秦侮吾孤，伐吾同姓，何德之報？」遂撃之。襄公墨衰絰。四月，敗秦師于殽，虜秦三將孟明視、西乞秫、白乙丙以歸。遂墨以葬文公。文公夫人秦女，謂襄公曰：「秦欲得其三將戮之。」公許，遣之。先軫聞之，謂襄公曰：「患生矣。」軫乃追秦將。秦將渡河，已在船中，頓首謝，卒不反。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"zql_k3t_8ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"秦伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"7du_pfa_2s5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"欒枝","kind":"person","person_id":"sar_gso_hyw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"zql_k3t_8ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"秦三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"孟明視","kind":"person","person_id":"ylb_ttg_8dr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"西乞秫","kind":"person","person_id":"7du_pfa_2s5_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0095","start":95,"end":98,"surface":"白乙丙","kind":"person","person_id":"7du_pfa_2s5_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"jgd_o1y_l7r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0137","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"zql_k3t_8ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m079-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"zql_k3t_8ro","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p005","text":"臣聞吏議逐客，竊以為過矣。昔繆公求士，西取由余於戎，東得百里奚於宛，迎蹇叔於宋，來丕豹、公孫支於晉。此五子者，不產於秦，而繆公用之，并國二十，遂霸西戎。孝公用商鞅之法，移風易俗，民以殷盛，國以富彊，百姓樂用，諸侯親服，獲楚、魏之師，舉地千里，至今治彊。惠王用張儀之計，拔三川之地，西并巴、蜀，北收上郡，南取漢中，包九夷，制鄢、郢，東據成皋之險，割膏腴之壤，遂散六國之從，使之西面事秦，功施到今。昭王得范睢，廢穰侯，逐華陽，彊公室，杜私門，蠶食諸侯，使秦成帝業。此四君者，皆以客之功。由此觀之，客何負於秦哉！向使四君卻客而不內，疏士而不用，是使國無富利之實而秦無彊大之名也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m005-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m005-0021","st